		{
			title: "A Glitch....?"
			icon: "minestuck:sbahjarang"
			x: 6.25d
			y: -5.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "MOD: Minestuck"
			description: [
				"&7Huh, I'm vaguely remembering one of the first systems they had for the FOPGame Server...remember that?"
				""
				"&dOh right, the one they got when they 'acquired' the old SBURB active worlds. It probably got wiped ages ago when they got the Vault Hunters system online. You and I played it some and tried to crack it. How come, squeaks?"
				""
				"&7Well, I used one of those old tools we coded up and well... I think I found a glitched item from a hole I poked. See, this data card?"
				""
				"&dWait. Wait a minute, you mean they just... left in that old code? That's... really important. Bandit, I'll split this off into its own section. Come check out the \"Stuck in the SBURB\" section. Squeaks, yer up."
				""
				"&7I'll take it from here, boss. Let's go Bandit, time to break some things."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["6DEFECFABD4DCB59"]
