		{
			title: "Of Skills and Preperation"
			icon: "minecraft:shulker_box"
			x: 3.75d
			y: 2.75d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Getting Ready"
			description: [
				"&5That's helpful. The early Vault Hunters quests you can do, they give you a free skill point and a Shulker Box before you go into your first Vault."
				""
				"&dVery handy. With the Shulker Box, you can store more loot in it from inside the Vault, and the Skill Point can be get you some kind of healing."
				""
				"&5Whoops, thats an important thing to note to Bandit, sis. "
				""
				"&dWhat do....OH, yeah, we almost forgot. Bandit, when you are inside a Vault, you do not heal naturally. Something about how they are twisting the worlds also twists how regular things function."
				""
				"&5So things like a full stomach won't regenerate health."
				""
				"&dI suggest choosing a Healing skill in your VH GUI (H Key by default). I also suggest getting some Iron Armor and a Diamond Sword, but thats up to you."
			]
			dependencies: ["19220F4E56CB0A0F"]
			hide: true
