		{
			title: "The Altar"
			icon: "the_vault:vault_altar"
			x: 1.75d
			y: 2.25d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "A Sacrifice of Material"
			description: [
				"&5Hm, okay, if you haven't already Bandit, I'd get at least a temporary base set up. You'll need the storage space."
				""
				"&dYou'll want a place to make your Vault Portal. And all your Vault work stations. You'll want your usual furnishings. Bed. Chests. A roof. "
				""
				"&5Some kind of defense turrets..."
				""
				"&dNot sure those are immediatley available, brother...not a bad idea however. Then you'll want to make yourself a Vault Altar. This is your key to the Vaults."
				""
				"&5Looks like you place the Altar down, and that one binds to you. Only you can place Vault Rocks onto it, which is how you start to make a Vault Crystal."
				""
				"&dThe items that show up? Those are the 'price' to make the Vault Crystal. Throw them at the Altar, then put down a Button or Lever against the Altar and activate them to finish creating the Vault Crystal."
			]
