			}
			x: -0.25d
			y: -2.75d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Entrance Fee"
			description: [
				"&5Hm, one of the major 'features' of the FOPGame Server is Vaults...but to get into them, you have to pay for Crystals, with an escalating cost the more you make."
				""
				"&dSo it encourages a User to build bigger and bigger farms to do more Vaulting, interesting."
				""
				"&5Yep, and the main reason for unlocking subsystems and other mods is to make these farms faster."
				""
				"&dHold on, looks like they have options for this too? You can make Crystals free to create, or even more expensive..."
				""
				"You can set the scaling of resources for Crystals with the following command : "
				"&6/gamerule vaultCrystalMode mode :&r Replace mode with one of the following :"
				"     Infinity (no cost)"
				"     Normal"
				"     Grindy"
				"     Extreme"
			]
			dependencies: ["4CA0844372B19F19"]
