		{
			title: "Group Survival"
			icon: "luphieclutteredmod:luphie_bunny_garland"
			x: 2.5d
			y: -2.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "More the Merrier"
			description: [
				"&dSince you aren't the only Power User around, Bandit, you may have already found someone to tackle the Vaults with."
				""
				"&5Keep in mind we're working with you to free all of them as well."
				""
				"&dThe FOPGame Server encourges partying with other Users to acquire more loot than they would individually."
				""
				"&5Survival in numbers, of course."
				""
				"To run Vaults with other players, you should form a party. You can do &6/party create&r, then &6/party invite player&r, where player is the name of the person you want to group with."
				""
				"To join a different party or go solo, be sure to do &6/party leave&r!"
			]
			dependencies: ["4CA0844372B19F19"]
