		{
			title: "Coins and Bills"
			icon: "lightmanscurrency:trading_core"
			x: 7.75d
			y: -3.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Mod: Lightman's Currency"
			description: [
				"&5Looks like the FOP include a trading and banking system called Lightman's Currency."
				""
				"&dA lot of useful things here for trading with other Users. Trading terminals. Vending machines. Display stands."
				""
				"&5And a slot machine? Isn't there another product they sell thats literally casino games?"
				""
				"&dYeah that's a bit weird. But let me just... okay, that Wallet we gave you earlier, Bandit? It'll let you store Ferret Dollars as well now. As for your bank account..."
				""
				"&2BANKING DATABASE UPDATED."
				""
				"&4SECURITY SYSTEM UPDATED FOR USER PROTECTION."
				""
				"&dDamn, I couldn't get the ATM to store Ferret Dollars as well. But you should be able to store both major currencies on you at least."
			]
