		{
			title: "Acidic Override"
			icon: "tfb2:blindboxblindbox"
			x: 5.5d
			y: -3.75d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "That was a test. So is this."
			description: [
				"&dWe've got a good overview of the major systems in that Game, Bandit. "
				""
				"&5And we've come up with a good way to break into the entire system..."
				""
				"&d...from the inside. You know that Blind Box of Blind Boxes we gave you earlier? That was actually a test box. I attached a tracking codespell on it and watched what happened with it."
				""
				"&5It's important because, like I said, we've not released that product yet. So my sister decided to see if we could hook the box up to the FOP Game Server itself."
				""
				"&dLayering so many systems made holes in their security, so I plugged one up with our own data pipe. So every one of those Blind Boxes you open up? Comes directly from their storage."
				""
				"&5Here. Send us 5 Chromatic Iron for another one. Then open it."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: [
				"78B5BCD7C6C45779"
