		{
			icon: "minestuck:amber_gummy_worm"
			x: 5.5d
			y: -1.75d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Infect the Server!"
			description: [
				"&dYes! Success! This is good, no security alerts, no tracked currency; I just need to edit the codespell a bit and..."
				""
				"&5Sis..."
				""
				"&dWhat? Oh, sorry Bandit! Okay, layferret's terms, the security hole we took over? They don't see the pipes we installed. And as long as we don't transfer things TOO fast in and out, they never will."
				""
				"&5Until it's too late. So, Bandit, we're going to Trojan Horse their entire system. But we have to do it slowly."
				""
				"&dThat's where you come in. These Blind Boxes will pull items from their storage server and give them directly to you. "
				""
				"&5Any items you collect now, we're going to 'infect' with a Worm, a little virus that will tag along with the item."
				""
				"&dWe call it the Audubon Worm. Fitting I feel, given the FOP are primarily birds."
			]
			dependencies: ["04D5AA9EB9007560"]
			hide: true
			id: "65766106B865F4F9"
			tasks: [{
				id: "718E8CAE36C0C76C"
				type: "checkmark"
				title: "The Audubon Worm"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "062DD7AF121EED37"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			icon: "mcwlights:double_street_lamp"
			x: 5.5d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Two Paths, One Goal"
			description: [
				"&dOkay, so infecting the items and Vault Coins is step 1. Step 2? Get them back into the system of course."
				""
				"&5You have a choice here, Bandit. You can sell items and trade Vault Coins back to FOP and purchase their AMAZINGLY priced DLC..."
				""
				"&dOr you can sell the items to us. We'll keep a portion of them, and send the rest back into their system. The Audubon Worm will very slowly spread without the FOP noticing."
				""
				"&5Take this TFB Shop Tablet. You can buy a resources from us, and learn how to sell to either us or the FOP."
				""
				"&dThe FOP's Vault Coins aren't too hard to earn... as long as you are vaulting. But we agree you could probably sell to both parties. Some things you can only get with Vault Coins, or some luck with our Blind Boxes. We have to limit how much we can sell you directly, as well. Using either or both, we get the Worm in their system."
				""
				"&dOkay, we're opening up the rest of the Q.U.E.S.T. sections to you, as well."
			]
			dependencies: ["65766106B865F4F9"]
			hide: true
			id: "14E05D152CF5C051"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7202B9F55F939F79"
				type: "checkmark"
				title: "A Thousand Drops"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "1ADDF83B4301F662"
