			x: 7.25d
			y: 2.75d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "And a Starting Gift"
			description: [
				"&dOkay Bandit, when you have your Vault Crystal made, you'll need to make the Vault Portal."
				""
				"&5It's just like the Nether Portal. A 4 wide, 5 tall frame of Vault Cobblestone. Or Vault Stone. Or Polished Vault Stone. You can make the portal looking nice."
				""
				"&dYou'll be using it a lot so that's always nice. After it's made, Right Click the Vault crystal onto the frame to open the portal, and step inside!"
				""
				"&5Once you do, you'll be teleported to another world. And if you've been following the Vault Hunter's quests, you should be given a Vault Sword and Shield to start you off."
				""
				"&dDon't leave the first room immediately! This is the Portal Room, it lets you prepare, as well as wait for other Users. Now hold those Unidentified items and Right Click with them!"
				""
				"&dOh! Let's also test if we can do this...you get to choose one more piece of equipment."
			]
