			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Preparing to Dial"
			description: [
				"&dOkay Bandit, you'll need to get started on the game loop, if we want any chance of getting a foothold with the Adubon Worm."
				""
				"&5Looking at the guide book they gave you, you'll need to get some more Chromatic Iron and some Vault Cobblestone."
				""
				"&dYep, also keep an eye out for diamonds as well, Bandit. You'll need them and Obsidian as well to start making Vault Portals."
				""
				"&5If you are having trouble finding any of these, we've piped some into the Shop Tablet supplies for sale."
				""
				"&dExcept the Obsidian. Some materials we're having problems getting for you."
				""
				"&5Oh! Also make sure you get a couple Vault Rocks! They drop from the Vault Stone, you'll need a bunch."
