		{
			title: "The Time of Your Life"
			icon: "botania:cosmetic_clock_eye"
			x: 9.25d
			y: 2.25d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Tick Tock Tick Tock"
			description: [
				"&dOnce you cross the arch into the first Hallway, the Vault Timer will start."
				""
				"&5You get 25 minutes, by default, to \"Complete\" a Vault. And by Complete, you should see a thing at the top of your view that talks about Elixir."
				""
				"&dEvery normal Vault has an \"Objective\", a goal for you to aim for to get bonus rewards. Some stuff you can only GET by completing a Vault successfully."
				""
				"&5Hm, I remember the only Objective you could get would be touching these monolith things...but it looks like they changed it."
				""
				"&dYeah, now your first available objective is called Elixir Rush. Your goal is to fill up that bar with Elixir, which are these purple orbs that 'explode' out of enemies and chests."
				""
				"&5Reading into it, each monster and chest type will have different amounts of Elixir. And it changes every time you enter a new Elixir Rush Vault."
			]
			dependencies: ["249CEFD98AF2D014"]
			id: "1F2875BC889232AC"
