			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Vein Mining By The Numbers"
			description: [
				"&5Bad news, Bandit. You won't have the same kind of Veinmining skill you had in your previous world."
				""
				"&dThe FOP entwined it with their Project MMO layer. So you need to level skills to be able to Veinmine more blocks."
				""
				"&5You still activate it by holding ~(grave) key, but you'll get an overlay telling you how many blocks you can veinmine with your current skill and tool."
				""
				"&dLeveling skills will help you veinmine more AND harder blocks. It does some calculation between your skill, how hard the block is, and your tool."
				""
				"&5Level Mining for ore, Woodcutting for logs, etc etc. You get the idea. But keep in mind, you have a charge bar for Veinmining as well. It slowly replenishes, but if you sleep at night, it recovers most of it."
				""
				"&dOh, and if you Veinmine trees, it breaks from the TOP, not the bottom."
			]
