		{
			title: "Researchers Unite"
			x: 3.25d
			y: -3.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "A Team For Knowledge"
			description: [
				"&dThe FOP have a lot of subsystems that aren't available to new Users, Power or otherwise. You have to 'research' them to unlock them."
				""
				"&5Not like our research I take it?"
				""
				"&dNo, more like earning the priviledge to use them. You need Knowledge to unlock the systems, things like Botania or Mekanism."
				""
				"&5By knowledge, you mean..."
				""
				"&dAn actual item you find inside the Vaults, of course. But hey, it looks like you can create a Research Team to combine multiple Users' \"Knowledge\"  to unlock them together."
				""
				"You can form a Research Team to unlock mods together. The cost of the Research goes up by 50% for each person added, but overall is cheaper for everyone on the team."
