				"&5Looks like.... a crate? Kind of reminds me of the shipping crates we used in your previous... adventure."
				""
				"&dI guess they do, kind of? Well, these Crates contain your rewards for completing the Vault Objective. You'll need to place it on the ground, then Sneak + Right Click to open it up."
				""
				"&5Makes a neat sound when it pops open. And some items you'll need can only be found in these Completion Crates."
				""
				"&dHmmmmm...."
