		{
			title: "The Price is Light"
			icon: "the_vault:vault_rock"
			x: 1.25d
			y: 2.8125d
			shape: "gear"
			subtitle: "Crystal Costs and You"
			description: [
				"&dInteresting on having to pay to make Vault Crystals. You would think they would want you in and out of the Vaults as easily as possible."
				""
				"&5Well, there does seem to be a game setting for making them like that, but paying for crystals is, how you say, the default mode?"
				""
				"&dWhy...let me look at something here..."
				""
				"&5What did you find, sis?"
				""
				"&dThe Crystals right now cost dirt. Both physically and metaphorically. But the more Crystals you make, the more their cost grows. And the more 'difficult' items are required."
				""
				"&5Hmm, thats interesting. So you'll have to pay more to be able to go into Vaults..."
				""
				"&dAnd you'll want to go into more Vaults to get more gear and to level up. And it looks like many of the subsystems you can unlock primarily help you get MORE of the items you need for Crystals."
			]
			dependencies: ["19220F4E56CB0A0F"]
